harness-eval — brownfield tasks
===============================

Brownfield tasks are derived from public GitHub repositories: each task pairs
an issue with the merged pull request that fixed it. Every task records its
upstream repository, issue, pull request, and base commit in its manifest.

Issue text and comments reproduced here are authored by their respective
GitHub users and remain theirs; they are included unmodified (reconstructed as
of a point in time) solely for evaluation and research. Patches are excerpts of
the upstream repositories, distributed under each repository's license.
Requests to remove content can be filed as issues on this repository.


